OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the second attempt to change the
OL,7,Flaw - last year an identical bill was
OL,8,Fsupported by MPs, but stalled and ran
OL,9,Fout of time in the House of Lords
OL,11,FThe bill would have allowed adults with
OL,12,Ffewer than six months to live to apply
OL,13,Fto be given help to end their own life,
OL,14,Fsubject to certain safeguards
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
